{"c":[{"id":"7d52b47ec9e85065","sum":"SumMem@78d91b7: one repo-root store; no scoped stores. TDD/preflight judge product-delivered or product-runtime behavior, not whatever a package manager or Actions runner executes (#116); prefer one steering principle over a tool exclusion list.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T203140Z-2cd50a583de58b13","text":"SumMem installed from Texarkanine/SumMem@78d91b7; one store only (repo-root .summem). Do not start scoped stores.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T203952Z-b85700bde1651227","text":"TDD/preflight must judge product-delivered or product-runtime behavior, not whatever a package manager or Actions runner executes (#116). Prefer one steering principle over an exclusion list of tools.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4caf0939404591cd","sum":"always-tdd scope (#116): the product's executable behavior, judged by whether a product user would observe the break. No excluded-tool or category lists (they get relabeled, lint is a CLI); no second definition echoed into preflight.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260820T204108Z-bdc4405c71cbf0c8","text":"always-tdd in-scope is the product's executable behavior; delete 'If something executes it'. Do not list excluded tools or echo a second definition into preflight (#116).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260820T204616Z-1620ce6f602992b6","text":"Category lists in always-tdd get relabeled (lint is a CLI). Scope by 'would a user of the product observe the break' matches the change-detector test; #116 shipped the smaller 'product's executable behavior' prefix instead.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
